## URL safety logic

- HTTP alone does not establish fraud.
- HTTPS does not prove legitimacy.
- Shortened links hide destinations; they are not automatically malicious.
- Suspicious domain is an indicator, not proof.
- Brand names in subdomains do not establish ownership.

